android-lib-buildkit
====================

Derived from https://github.com/android/nowinandroid
("Now in Android", Copyright The Android Open Source Project),
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

See LICENSE for the full license text.

Changes relative to the upstream project include, but are not limited to:

- Extraction of the build/quality toolchain (build-logic convention plugins,
  lint checks, spotless config, ui-test-hilt-manifest, benchmarks) into a
  standalone repository.
- Renaming of the package namespace from
  `com.google.samples.apps.nowinandroid` to `com.z1nt.buildkit`, and of the
  `Nia*` symbols (`NiaIssueRegistry` -> `BuildkitIssueRegistry`,
  `NiaFlavor` -> `BuildkitFlavor`, `NiaBuildType` -> `BuildkitBuildType`).
- Gradle plugin id prefix changed from `nowinandroid.*` to `buildkit.*`.
- Removal of Firebase / Google Services / dependency-guard integrations.
